    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<strong>This is an interesting tower defense (TD) Game.</strong><br>You can use the mixed reactions among the seven elements of wind, thunder, water, fire, earth, light and dark to create a powerful element tower and defeat the invading enemy!<br>At the same time, there will be plenty of dropped props and player skills in the game. With your unique element lineup, challenge the powerful monster leader!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Summon Elemental</li></ul>You can draw element cards by consuming gold coins each round, and you have a chance to get super rare elements!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Elemental Reaction</li></ul>Different elements in the field can react with each other to create more powerful elemental creations. At the same time, high-level creations will also react with elements, continue to synthesize upward, and create unparalleled powerful elements!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150310/extras/de941462c3b7c827b1ab1b3408a2d0e8.avif?t=1748941195\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Strategy Matching</li></ul>Each element has different characteristics, and a reasonable combination of element towers is the key to victory!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenge BOSS</li></ul>There will be a variety of monster leaders with special abilities in the game. Players need to match reasonable element lineups according to monster characteristics to defeat them!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Magic prop</li></ul>Elite monsters may drop various magic props when they die. Equipping them to the element tower can strengthen various abilities of the element tower or bring special effects.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Summoning Skills</li></ul>When the player's Summoner level is upgraded, he will gain one skill point. The skill points consumed can be obtained from one of the three Summoning Skills.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Player Ranking</li></ul>In the follow-up of the game, infinite mode and player ranking will be launched, and the names of players and element lineups with the largest number of monsters defeated will be recorded.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>This is an interesting tower defense (TD) Game.</strong><br>You can use the mixed reactions among the seven elements of wind, thunder, water, fire, earth, light and dark to create a powerful element tower and defeat the invading enemy!<br>At the same time, there will be plenty of dropped props and player skills in the game. With your unique element lineup, challenge the powerful monster leader!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Summon Elemental</li></ul>You can draw element cards by consuming gold coins each round, and you have a chance to get super rare elements!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Elemental Reaction</li></ul>Different elements in the field can react with each other to create more powerful elemental creations. At the same time, high-level creations will also react with elements, continue to synthesize upward, and create unparalleled powerful elements!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150310/extras/de941462c3b7c827b1ab1b3408a2d0e8.avif?t=1748941195\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Strategy Matching</li></ul>Each element has different characteristics, and a reasonable combination of element towers is the key to victory!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenge BOSS</li></ul>There will be a variety of monster leaders with special abilities in the game. Players need to match reasonable element lineups according to monster characteristics to defeat them!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Magic prop</li></ul>Elite monsters may drop various magic props when they die. Equipping them to the element tower can strengthen various abilities of the element tower or bring special effects.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Summoning Skills</li></ul>When the player's Summoner level is upgraded, he will gain one skill point. The skill points consumed can be obtained from one of the three Summoning Skills.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Player Ranking</li></ul>In the follow-up of the game, infinite mode and player ranking will be launched, and the names of players and element lineups with the largest number of monsters defeated will be recorded.",
    "short_description": "The ancient forest was invaded by evil creatures, Brave summoner, pray for the power of elements, prepare to meet fierce and brutal opponents! Mix different elements to create a unique element creation! Defeat the attacking monster, obtain rare props, and strengthen the power of Elemental!",
